  "details": "I've had this idea for a while, just to make everything feel a little more personal. So, I absolutely adored the color-coded nameplates, and I wanted to bring that back in a way. So, to keep the simplistic design we currently have going, Instead of changing the color of the nameplate itself I suggest making it so that a user can change the color and behavior of the ripples that appear when you speak, As well as maybe a custom pattern background for the actual nameplate.",
